{"notes":["# Product Verdict — sto:local-deploy-observability (657c818) → SHIP READY (observability slice, with 2 minor follow-ups)\n\nExecutive Verdict: SHIP READY. Scope terpenuhi end-to-end: progress 0→100 human vs JSON, verify per-check PASS/FAIL, status human table vs JSON envelope, error_matrix 6 kinds + host_key, audit durable SIEM ship-ready. Tidak ada blocking issue MVP.\n\n## UX Audit Checklist\n\n- Progress 0→100 PASS: internal/output/deploy_progress.go DeployProgress.PushTicks + EmitPushProgress emits 0% 25% 50% 75% 100% deterministik, dipakai di cmd/deploy.go human path. JSON tidak bawa % (by design — human stream), tapi human+JSON share artifact_id/version/checksum via ValidateDeployHumanJSONConsistency. Evidence: spikes/local-deploy-ux/evidence/progress.log + deploy_progress_test.go.\n- Gap minor (post-merge): tick saat ini pre-computed sebelum transport.Deliver, bukan live SCP byte callback. Rekomendasi follow-up #1: wire progress reader ke SSH transport.\n- Verify per-check PASS/FAIL PASS: CompleteVerify + RenderVerifyChecks via output.PrintStatus [PASS]/[FAIL] per check (6 checks). Spike dryrun_human.txt + progress_verify_fail.log + deploy_progress_test VerifyPerCheckVisible PASS.\n- Status human vs JSON PASS: cmd/status.go human Project/Version/Lifecycle/Configuration + Server Lifecycle (Active/Installed/Rollback/RuntimeState) dari server.QueryLifecycleStatus (release.GetActiveRelease, ListReleases, GetRollbackEligibility, runtime.StateStore.Load) read-only, crash-window symlink-removed test PASS. JSON envelope v1 {project,lifecycle,configuration,server_lifecycle,active,installed,rollback,runtime_state} vs spike status_after_activate.json. Tests status_observability_test.go PASS, TestQueryLifecycleStatus_ReadOnly byte-identical.\n- --json envelope v1 PASS: output.WriteJSON version 1 status success, WriteJSONError version 1 status error — dry-run, deploy, status semua valid.\n- error_matrix PASS: docs/error_matrix.md 7 rows (6 kinds + host_key_verification_failed) + notes canonical UX 6 visible + 2 internal (transfer_failed). Exit codes 0/1/2/4 stabil via TransportError.Guidance/ExitCode, human 3-part Error/Reason/Resolution via output.AppError, redaction via RedactSecrets/SanitizeLogLine. Help + error_matrix.csv consistent.\n- Audit ship-ready PASS: internal/deployment/audit.go JSON-lines O_APPEND|O_SYNC+Sync+0600, HMAC hash-chain prev_hash→hash, binding to SSH principal (creds.User) not spoofable string, VerifyChain tamper detection, redaction, Permissions 0600 verified. Docs/error_matrix.md SIEM tail via filebeat. Tests audit_test.go HMACChain+Binding PASS.\n- Rollback re-verify: ServerReleaseCoordinator.Activate RequireVerified sebelum ExtractArtifact + Rollback re-verify archived artifact — TOCTOU closed.\n\n## Product Evaluation (Althea lens)\n\n- User value HIGH: dev dapat feedback push % + per-check fail reason, automation dapat parse --json, operator dapat tail audit tanpa secret leak.\n- Business value HIGH: menutup observability gap wave3, membuat verification-before-trust tidak blackbox, menurunkan support load.\n- Effort MEDIUM: reuse spike harness internal/output+artifact, wrap PlainStepReporter, deterministic ticks — minimal complexity.\n- Operational cost LOW: O_SYNC + HMAC minor perf, storage linear JSON-lines.\n- Maintainability HIGH: struct tanpa json tags masih PascalCase untuk internal, tapi JSON server_lifecycle saat ini expose PascalCase — match spike lowercase? minor follow-up #2: tambah json tags snake_case atau DTO.\n- Opportunity cost accepted: live streaming progress ditunda demi ship slice.\n\n## Trade-offs Considered\n\n- Simulated ticks vs live: pilih simulated dulu untuk ship, live streaming post-merge.\n- 6 UX-visible vs 8 total kinds: docs sudah perjelas kanonical, tapi tabel docs vs transport.go AllKinds 8 perlu sync note.\n- Audit log path split (.anvil/audit.log vs audit.log): NewAuditLogger fallback dual, perlu standarisasi ke .anvil (follow-up minor).\n\n## Decisions \u0026 Rationale\n\n- SHIP observability wave3: semua AC1-4 observability terverifikasi via tests spike pattern, no critical data-corruption.\n- Follow-ups tidak block: live progress callback + json snake_case tags + audit path standardisation.\n\n## Open Questions\n\n- Server Lifecycle JSON field naming: apakah automation sudah expect snake_case release_id? Jika ya, prioritaskan follow-up #2 segera.\n- Audit tail: apakah SIEM konfig tail .anvil/audit.log primary, fallback audit.log secondary? Dokumentasi perlu eksplisit.\n\n## Recommended Next Steps\n\n1. Merge feat/sto-local-deploy-observability setelah sign-off product + tech review (request_changes High di technical review perlu di-triage: audit racy/Entries skip harus di-fix jika dianggap blocking oleh eng).\n2. File follow-up ticket: (a) Wire live push progress callback di SSHTransport.Deliver, (b) Add json tags snake_case ke observability structs, (c) Standardise audit log path ke .anvil/audit.log.\n3. Publish ctr:local-deploy-mvp completion setelah semua wave3 checks green.\n\nWorkdir: /home/marij/maleolabs/anvil/worktrees/feat-sto-local-deploy-observability — reviewed by Althea Product (muse-spark-1.2).\n"],"role":"review","verdict":"approve"}